{title: Ode to Joy}
{artist: Beethoven}
{key: C}
{tempo: 95}
{time: 4/4}

[C]Joy! [C]Beau- [C]ti- [F]ful
[C]spark [C]of [C]di- [G]vin-
[Am]i- [Am]ty, [Am]daugh- [F]ter
[C]of [C]E- [G]ly- [G]si-
[C]um! [C]Drunk [C]with [F]fire
[C]we [C]en- [C]ter, [G]heav-
[Am]en! [Am]Your [F]ma- [F]gic
[C]binds [C]what [G]rig- [G]id
[C]cus- [C]tom [F]di- [G]vid-
[C]ed, [C]all [C]men [C]stand
